芬轻视与嫌恶，罗静芬心怀叵测，暗中与奸夫勾结，密谋暗害丈夫方继舟，欲借刀杀人，恰逢帝王数年无嗣，广求天下名医救治，罗静芬深知方继舟医术平平，却故意当众以方继舟的名誉揭下皇榜，其用心之险恶，无非是想借帝王之手，除掉方继舟。","series_id":"7463315337790884926","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623572203F236407ACF51ABC80E\",\"rank\":\"3\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7463315337790884926\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"finish\\\":0.039048295468091965,\\\"like\\\":0.06754669547080994,\\\"collect\\\":0.046724967658519745,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.029148777946829796,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.492791771888733,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.997378945350647,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.16711676120758057}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7463315337790884926","play_cnt":85482,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"树下的椰子","sub_title":"古装·逆袭翻身","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":60,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5007,\"name\":\"古装\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5007&categoryName=古装&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5070,\"name\":\"逆袭翻身\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5070&categoryName=逆袭翻身&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5123,\"name\":\"穿越\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5123&categoryName=穿越&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5176,\"name\":\"虐渣\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5176&categoryName=虐渣&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5312,\"name\":\"架空\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5312&categoryName=架空&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5339,\"name\":\"古代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5339